sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Student
    participant UI as Search UI (proposed)
    participant API as Search API (proposed)
    participant DB as ORM / PostgreSQL
    Note over UI,DB: US2 proposed - confirm interval boundaries, visibility and state policy before implementation
    U->>UI: Select sport, venue, indoor/outdoor and time, or reset
    UI->>UI: Normalize controls, increment request version, loading
    UI->>API: GET /api/v1/parties?filters + session
    API->>API: Validate access, query types and timezone Asia/Bangkok
    alt Invalid access or query
        API-->>UI: Error per contract, no misleading old results
        UI-->>U: Error and retry/reset
    else Valid query
        API->>DB: AND filters: sport AND venue/type AND agreed time predicate
        Note over API,DB: State visibility matches Detail, sport is not venue type
        DB-->>API: Matching Parties and current member counts
        API->>API: Map state and public fields using shared Detail rules
        API-->>UI: Results per agreed query contract
        alt Response version is stale
            UI->>UI: Ignore stale response
        else Current response is empty
            UI-->>U: Empty state and reset action
        else Current results
            UI-->>U: Matching Parties, Join availability follows Detail
        end
    end
    Note over UI,API: Network/server failures show retry, response-version guard also applies to errors
    Note over U,DB: Search reserves no court or seat, Join Request must recheck current state on server
